** Probe: OU design-value keywords and FILEFORM on the AERTEST case (SO2,
** 1988 Albany met). Full run so the files are produced. MAXDCONT refuses
** SAVEFILE/INITFILE/MULTYEAR (E153), so the restart probes are separate.
CO STARTING
   TITLEONE  oracle 01: MAXDAILY MXDYBYYR MAXDCONT FILEFORM
   MODELOPT  CONC  FLAT
   AVERTIME  1
   POLLUTID  SO2
   RUNORNOT  RUN
   ERRORFIL  probe01.err
CO FINISHED

SO STARTING
   LOCATION  STACK1  POINT  0.0  0.0  0.0
   SRCPARAM  STACK1  500.0  65.00  425.  15.0  5.
   SRCGROUP  ALL
SO FINISHED

RE STARTING
RE GRIDPOLR POL1 STA
                 ORIG STACK1
                 DIST 175. 500.
                 GDIR 12 0 30
RE GRIDPOLR POL1 END
RE FINISHED

ME STARTING
   SURFFILE  AERMET2.SFC
   PROFFILE  AERMET2.PFL
   SURFDATA  14735  1988  ALBANY,NY
   UAIRDATA  14735  1988  ALBANY,NY
   PROFBASE  0.0  METERS
ME FINISHED

OU STARTING
   RECTABLE  ALLAVE  1-4
   MAXTABLE  ALLAVE  10
   FILEFORM  EXP
   MAXDAILY  ALL  probe01_maxdaily.dat
   MXDYBYYR  ALL  probe01_mxdybyyr.dat
   MAXDCONT  ALL  4  4  probe01_maxdcont.dat
   PLOTFILE  1  ALL  FOURTH  probe01.plt
   POSTFILE  1  ALL  PLOT  probe01.pst  41
OU FINISHED
